    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c1_body",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 207,
      "width": 284,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "Analyzes legacy Git commits, directory\nlayout, and identifier patterns BEFORE code\nis touched. Recovers co-change coupling and\nchurn hotspots, clusters domain concepts,\nand reconstructs architectural layers so\ndownstream LLMs understand true module\nboundaries without hallucinating legacy\nidiosyncrasies.",
      "originalText": "Analyzes legacy Git commits, directory\nlayout, and identifier patterns BEFORE code\nis touched. Recovers co-change coupling and\nchurn hotspots, clusters domain concepts,\nand reconstructs architectural layers so\ndownstream LLMs understand true module\nboundaries without hallucinating legacy\nidiosyncrasies.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
