    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c2_title",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 465,
      "width": 273,
      "height": 17,
      "text": "Deep Codebase & Invariant Profiling",
      "originalText": "Deep Codebase & Invariant Profiling",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c2_body",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 487,
      "width": 291,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "Builds static and dynamic representations of\nthe source tree. Uses Tree-Sitter for AST\nparsing, runs dynamic invariant mining\n(pointer nullability, allocation ranges)\nfrom test executions, maps obsolete third-\nparty libraries to idiomatic target crates,\nand selects the global migration strategy\n(Big Bang / Incremental).",
      "originalText": "Builds static and dynamic representations of\nthe source tree. Uses Tree-Sitter for AST\nparsing, runs dynamic invariant mining\n(pointer nullability, allocation ranges)\nfrom test executions, maps obsolete third-\nparty libraries to idiomatic target crates,\nand selects the global migration strategy\n(Big Bang / Incremental).",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
