    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c3_title",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 745,
      "width": 328,
      "height": 17,
      "text": "Dependency Ordering & Skeleton Scaffolding",
      "originalText": "Dependency Ordering & Skeleton Scaffolding",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c3_body",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 767,
      "width": 278,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "Decomposes large codebases into atomic AST\nfragments that fit LLM context limits.\nPerforms reverse-topological sorting so\ndependencies translate before consumers,\nresolves cyclic import dependencies with\nstub scheduling, and generates compilable\ntarget skeleton files to anchor downstream\ntranslation passes.",
      "originalText": "Decomposes large codebases into atomic AST\nfragments that fit LLM context limits.\nPerforms reverse-topological sorting so\ndependencies translate before consumers,\nresolves cyclic import dependencies with\nstub scheduling, and generates compilable\ntarget skeleton files to anchor downstream\ntranslation passes.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
