    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c7_body",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 402,
      "width": 291,
      "height": 97,
      "text": "Compiling code can still diverge in runtime\nbehavior. Deploys an ensemble of independent\njudge agents to score behavioral equivalence\nbetween source and target implementations\nacross edge cases, evaluating semantics and\nexecution traces. Majority consensus gates\nrelease.",
      "originalText": "Compiling code can still diverge in runtime\nbehavior. Deploys an ensemble of independent\njudge agents to score behavioral equivalence\nbetween source and target implementations\nacross edge cases, evaluating semantics and\nexecution traces. Majority consensus gates\nrelease.",
