    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c8_body",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 187,
      "width": 291,
      "height": 97,
      "text": "Meta-learning controller triggered when\nvalidation fails. If translation plateaus or\nfails, switches migration strategy via a\ntry-and-fail registry (e.g. Big Bang ->\nIncremental), re-tunes active tools and\nparameters, and bundles prioritized compiler\ndiagnostics into a distilled repair packet.",
      "originalText": "Meta-learning controller triggered when\nvalidation fails. If translation plateaus or\nfails, switches migration strategy via a\ntry-and-fail registry (e.g. Big Bang ->\nIncremental), re-tunes active tools and\nparameters, and bundles prioritized compiler\ndiagnostics into a distilled repair packet.",
      "fontSize": 11,
